The 2 x 2 quad4 mesh of geometry_moving_band1; a -geometry_point of radius 0.3 sweeps y -0.05..0.55 from time 0 to 2.
Every sample point of the bottom elements enters: part 1, the delete factor reaches 0 and the elements 1 and 2 are deleted, also the nodes 1 2 3 on y 0.
The top elements: only the row y 0.525 of the 10 x 10 points enters, part 0.1, delete factor 0.9 at the end.
)
